From b911a4a576ec4e526ad57e17aa7990d0026ad228 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:52:39 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Plan v2 Phase 1: remove Positions, Case Library, dashboards,
 Compare and AI chat

- Positions become a free-text "Job title / vacancy" on each assessment. The
  positions UI, picker and position x level grid are removed. Migration 0016
  copies position titles into assessments.vacancy_title; the tables stay for
  one release.
- Case Library screens are removed. The case_library table stays as a quality
  bank; its parsers move to src/lib/question-import.ts for a later import feature.
- Home is the review queue (paged) plus recent submissions. Reports overview,
  charts, analytics export, Compare, Scout and the report chat are removed.
- Section and question deletes are refused once a candidate has started the
  assessment, in the app and by a database guard (plan section 9, item 1).
- Candidate PDF requires status "reviewed" and omits the AI rationale
  (section 9, item 2).
- Archiving records the previous status; restore goes back to it through
  restore_archived_assessment() (section 9, item 4).
- New assessments get the default AI engine (section 9, item 5).
- Migration 0016 reconciles candidate_reviews.decision with the eight
  purpose-aware values the app writes (section 9, item 6).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VwbNAvHSSauSWXKNV6DNV9
